s incompressible (area-preserving)"},{"id":"setup","title":"Initial and boundary conditions (this preset)","ic":"Alternating horizontal dye bands (0/1) with the chosen number of stripes; no flow.","bc":"Periodic in both directions; the stirring velocity is zero.","preset":{"bands":6,"stir":0.0,"diffusion":0.0004}},{"id":"numerics","title":"Numerical method, checks and limitations","text":"The turbulent velocity comes from the same spectral vorticity solver; the dye is a passive scalar advected by it with periodic bilinear semi-Lagrangian transport (unconditionally stable) and a touch of spectral diffusion.","checks":"Analytical comparison: for stripes with wavenumber m the variance decays as exp(−2κ m² t) (tested in tests/).","status":"Analytical comparison"},{"id":"refs","title":"References","items":["Ottino, J.M. (1989). The Kinematics of Mixing: Stretching, Chaos, and Transport. Cambridge."]}],"experiment":{"id":"dye_transport","name":"Dye transport","question":"How much apparent mixing comes from stirring and how much from diffusion?","preset_label":"Diffusion only","presets":[{"key":"mix_diffusion","label":"Diffusion only","exhibit":"Ink in Motion"},{"key":"mix_stir","label":"Stirring only","exhibit":"Ink in Motion"},{"key":"mix_bands","label":"Stirring with diffusion","exhibit":"Ink in Motion"}],"compare":[{"a":"mix_diffusion","b":"mix_bands","text":"Diffusion alone versus stirring with diffusion from the same initial bands."},{"a":"mix_stir","b":"mix_bands","text":"Stirring alone (numerical diffusion only) versus stirring with physical diffusion."}]},"cmap":null,"params":[{"name":"bands","label":"Dye bands","type":"int","default":6,"min":2,"max":14,"group":"Geometry","help":"How many horizontal stripes of dye to start with.","hard_min":1,"hard_max":64},{"name":"diffusion","label":"Dye diffusivity κ","type":"float","default":0.0001,"min":0.0,"max":0.001,"group":"Physics","help":"Molecular diffusion of the dye — higher blurs the fine filaments sooner. 0 = pure stirring (only numerical diffusion remains).","hard_min":0,"hard_max":0.05},{"name":"stir","label":"Stirring strength","type":"float","default":1.0,"min":0.0,"max":1.0,"group":"Physics","help":"Multiplies the stirring velocity: 1 = the full turbulent flow, 0 = diffusion only (compare how much mixing comes from stirring versus diffusion).","hard_min":0,"hard_max":3,"advanced":true},{"name":"seed","label":"Random seed","type":"int","default":3,"min":0,"max":9999,"group":"Physics","help":"Seed of the random stirring flow.","hard_min":0,"hard_max":2147483647,"advanced":true},{"name":"resolution","label":"Resolution","type":"choice","choices":["Low (fast)","Medium","High","Ultra (slow)"],"default":"Medium","group":"Render","help":"Grid resolution. It changes the grid, and with it whatever a scene ties to the grid: the elapsed convective time in the wind tunnel, the Rayleigh number in the convection scenes, the grain size in the rock, the extent of the blast box. The derived readouts say what moved for this experiment; runs at different resolutions are comparable only where they say so."},{"name":"duration","label":"Duration (×)","type":"float","default":1.0,"min":0.2,"max":6.0,"hard_min":0.05,"hard_max":20.0,"group":"Render","help":"Simulated interval as a multiple of the scene's reference interval (1.0 = default)."}],"method_label":"Chaotic mixing · spectral + passive scalar","web_case":"dye_transport__mix_diffusion"}